{% doc %}
  Supplied model specifications shared by navigation and product sections.
  @param {string} [model] - Product handle.
  @param {string} field - Specification label, rows, image, or handles.
{% enddoc %}
{%- if field == 'handles' -%}t-01,t-02
{%- elsif model == 't-01' or model == 't-02' -%}
  {%- if field == 'image' -%}
    {%- if model == 't-01' -%}panquire-t01.png{%- else -%}panquire-t02.png{%- endif -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- capture rows -%}
Overview|Model|{{ model | upcase }}
Overview|Type|Electric Dirt Bike
Overview|Frame material|Aluminum Alloy
Overview|Color|{% if model == 't-01' %}Bronze Gold{% else %}Black{% endif %}
Overview|Warranty|1 Year
Overview|After-sales service|1 Year
Performance|Motor|{% if model == 't-01' %}60V 3,000W Central Motor{% else %}72V 6,000W Central Motor{% endif %}
Performance|Peak motor power|{% if model == 't-01' %}8000W{% else %}11,000W{% endif %}
Performance|Maximum speed|{% if model == 't-01' %}80 km/h{% else %}100 km/h{% endif %}
Performance|Range — Eco mode|{% if model == 't-01' %}80 km{% else %}90 km{% endif %}
Performance|Climbing ability|<30°
Performance|Max load|150 kg
Performance|Drivetrain|Chain Drive
Performance|Gears|3-Speed
Battery & charging|Battery|Lithium Battery
Battery & charging|Battery voltage|{% if model == 't-01' %}60V{% else %}72V{% endif %}
Battery & charging|Battery capacity|{% if model == 't-01' %}31.2Ah{% else %}41Ah{% endif %}
Battery & charging|Charger|6A
Suspension & brakes|Front/rear suspension|Hydraulic Suspension
Suspension & brakes|Rear shock|Adjustable Oil Hydraulic Nitrogen Shock Absorber
Suspension & brakes|Brakes|Hydraulic Disc Brakes
Suspension & brakes|Brake pads|Hydraulic Brake Pads
Suspension & brakes|Front tire|19 inches
Suspension & brakes|Rear tire|17 inches
Dimensions & weight|Vehicle dimensions|1770 × 800 × 1200 mm
